The Writ Petition (Crl.) is filed with the following prayer:
(i) issue a writ of mandamus or any other appropriate writ, order or direction commanding the 2nd respondent to pass appropriate orders to the officials concerned who are in charge of the investigation in Exhibit P1 crime, to further investigate the case, especially the role played by the co-conspirators of the accused as well as the commission of offences under Sections 182, 385, 499 and 503 of the Indian Penal Code by the accused which is revealed in the FIS, in view of the deficiencies in Exhibit P3 Final Report, in order to ensure that the guilty do not escape the clutches of law;
